{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.MotivicGaloisCharacter","lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.MotivicPerpetualObstruction","lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.DirectLimitAlgebra","lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.compatible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.compatible","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent.lean#L76-L76","doc":"Compatibility with truncation: trunc_n ∘ proj_{n+1} = proj_n. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.projection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.projection","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent.lean#L74-L74","doc":"Projection to each finite jet level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.Carrier","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.Carrier","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent.lean#L72-L72","doc":"The carrier of the arc space (inverse limit of jet schemes). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.mk","kind":"ctor","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace","kind":"structure","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent.lean#L61-L76","doc":"The **arc space** `L(X)` of a variety `X` over a chosen jet tower.\n\n`L(X) = lim_{←n} L_n(X)` is the inverse limit of the jet\nschemes. In QOU it equals the inverse limit of the recursive\nbrane tower `𝓢_∞ := lim_n 𝓢_n`. Carries the formal data\nneeded for motivic integration even when `X` is singular.\n\nThe `compatible` field is the inverse-system law: each\nprojection equals the next, post-composed with truncation. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:arc-space","label":"def:arc-space","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/arc-space.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower.truncation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower.truncation","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The truncation map `L_{n+1}(X) → L_n(X)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower.level","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The n-th jet scheme. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower.mk","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower","kind":"structure","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent.lean#L53-L59","doc":"A **jet tower** for `X`: the whole family of jet schemes\n`L_n(X)` together with the truncation maps `L_{n+1}(X) → L_n(X)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetScheme.Carrier","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JetScheme.Carrier","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Underlying scheme of the n-th jet space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetScheme.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JetScheme.mk","kind":"ctor","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetScheme","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JetScheme","kind":"structure","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent.lean#L42-L51","doc":"The **n-th jet scheme** `L_n(X)` of a variety `X`.\n\nRepresents the functor `R ↦ Hom(Spec R[t]/(t^{n+1}), X)`.\nIn QOU it is identified with the n-th level of the recursive\nbrane tower `𝓢_n`. The structure exposes only the carrier of\n`L_n(X)`; the truncation map `L_{n+1}(X) → L_n(X)` lives on\n`JetTower` (it is inherently a level-shifting map). ","signatureChunk":0}]}